# ---- Data dirs: track code + index files, ignore user content ----

# memory/: track code (*.py, __init__.py) but NOT the memory markdown files
memory/**/*.md
!memory/README.md
memory/user/
memory/feedback/
memory/project/
memory/general/

# knowledge/: track code, don't track user's knowledge notes
knowledge/*/
!knowledge/**/__init__.py
knowledge/**/*.md
!knowledge/README.md

# Voice: heavy models and runtime state
voice/models/
voice/__pycache__/

# Legacy / backup files from the restructure
*.old

# --- added 2026-09-02 during repo repair ---
# Persona.md is Raghav's personal assistant persona and this repo is PUBLIC.
# It was NOT ignored and NOT tracked, so any `git add -A` would have published
# it. Two old commits touch the path but neither exposes content, and it is
# absent from origin/master HEAD, so nothing has leaked.
Persona.md

# venv that .venv/ did not match — 8,708 files, 292MB of the untracked noise
.venv-wake/
voice/.venv-wake/

# node_modules under desktop-electron was untracked (5,324 files)
node_modules/

# local build/run noise
*.log
*.bak-*
chats/.serena-handoff.md

